      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787724791242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "公開ゲームデータ — public/data/\n\npublic/data/characters.csv\n  └ CharacterDefinition / icon・animation参照\npublic/data/moves.csv\n  └ MoveDefinition / command・projectile参照\npublic/data/commands.csv\n  └ CommandDefinition\npublic/data/projectiles.csv\n  └ ProjectileDefinition / PNG参照\npublic/data/CSV設定項目一覧.txt\n\npublic/data/animations/crocodile_soldier.json\n  └ Blender sprite action poses / fallback参照\npublic/data/characters/crocodile_soldier/\n  ├ fallback.png / JSON単体画像\n  ├ icon.png / 選択画面アイコン\n  └ <state>/*.png / 状態別60FPS連番\npublic/data/create-character-folders.bat\n  └ ID入力から状態フォルダを作成\npublic/data/projectiles/take.png\npublic/data/sounds/slap-1.mp3\n\n参照整合性は definitions.ts が起動時に検証",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "公開ゲームデータ — public/data/\n\npublic/data/characters.csv\n  └ CharacterDefinition / icon・animation参照\npublic/data/moves.csv\n  └ MoveDefinition / command・projectile参照\npublic/data/commands.csv\n  └ CommandDefinition\npublic/data/projectiles.csv\n  └ ProjectileDefinition / PNG参照\npublic/data/CSV設定項目一覧.txt\n\npublic/data/animations/crocodile_soldier.json\n  └ Blender sprite action poses / fallback参照\npublic/data/characters/crocodile_soldier/\n  ├ fallback.png / JSON単体画像\n  ├ icon.png / 選択画面アイコン\n  └ <state>/*.png / 状態別60FPS連番\npublic/data/create-character-folders.bat\n  └ ID入力から状態フォルダを作成\npublic/data/projectiles/take.png\npublic/data/sounds/slap-1.mp3\n\n参照整合性は definitions.ts が起動時に検証",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "af"
    },
